On the show today:

A judge rules in favor of excluding evidence in the Luigi Mangione trial… and Mangione fans are ecstatic;

Thomas Massie is engaged in a knock-down, drag-out primary with a Trump-endorsed Republican;

and the Call Her Daddy lady is happily married and pregnant, unlike all the ladies who took her life advice.

